<svg aria-hidden="true" class="lucide lucide-file-text" fill="none" height="14" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="14" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
<path d="M6 22a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h8a2.4 2.4 0 0 1 1.704.706l3.588 3.588A2.4 2.4 0 0 1 20 8v12a2 2 0 0 1-2 2z">
</path>
<path d="M14 2v5a1 1 0 0 0 1 1h5">
</path>
<path d="M10 9H8">
</path>
<path d="M16 13H8">
</path>
<path d="M16 17H8">
</path>
</svg>Editorial plan</span>
<div class="ls-sidebar-bottom">
<svg aria-hidden="true" class="lucide lucide-moon" fill="none" height="15" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="15" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
<path d="M20.985 12.486a9 9 0 1 1-9.473-9.472c.405-.022.617.46.402.803a6 6 0 0 0 8.268 8.268c.344-.215.825-.004.803.401">
</path>
</svg>
<span>Night Shift<br/>
<small data-demo-state="true">Ready for tonight</small>
</span>
</div>
</aside>
<div class="ls-document-pane">
<div class="ls-document-meta">
<span>STUDIO / THIS WEEK</span>
<span data-demo-time="true">18:40</span>
</div>
<h3>A clearer view<br/>of the week.</h3>
<p class="ls-demo-body">Three workstreams. One living picture.</p>
<div class="ls-mini-table">
<div>
<b>Workstream</b>
<b>Done</b>
</div>
<div>
<span>Research</span>
<span>8 / 10</span>
</div>
<div class="ls-changing-row">
<span>Launch</span>
<span>
<span class="ls-before-value">4 / 8</span>
<span class="ls-after-value">6 / 8</span>
</span>
</div>
<div>
<span>Editorial</span>
<span>3 / 6</span>
</div>
</div>
<div aria-label="Illustrative work completion: Research 80 percent, Launch changes from 50 to 75 percent, Editorial 50 percent." class="ls-mini-chart" role="img">
<div>
<i style="height:80%">
</i>
<span>Research</span>
</div>
<div class="ls-changing-bar">
<i>
</i>
<span>Launch</span>
</div>
<div>
<i style="height:50%">
</i>
<span>Editorial</span>
</div>
</div>
<p class="ls-bound-source">
<svg aria-hidden="true" class="lucide lucide-link2 lucide-link-2" fill="none" height="12" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="12" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
<path d="M9 17H7A5 5 0 0 1 7 7h2">
</path>
<path d="M15 7h2a5 5 0 1 1 0 10h-2">
</path>
<line x1="8" x2="16" y1="12" y2="12">
</line>
</svg>Bound to team update files</p>
</div>
<div class="ls-review-pane">
<div class="ls-review-pane-heading">
<svg aria-hidden="true" class="lucide lucide-sun" fill="none" height="17" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="17" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
<circle cx="12" cy="12" r="4">
</circle>
<path d="M12 2v2">
</path>
<path d="M12 20v2">
</path>
<path d="m4.93 4.93 1.41 1.41">
</path>
<path d="m17.66 17.66 1.41 1.41">
</path>
<path d="M2 12h2">
</path>
<path d="M20 12h2">
</path>
<path d="m6.34 17.66-1.41 1.41">
</path>
<path d="m19.07 4.93-1.41 1.41">
</path>
</svg>
<span>Morning Briefing</span>
</div>
<h4 data-demo-title="true">Your next useful version.</h4>
<div class="ls-demo-events">
<p data-demo-event="1">
<svg aria-hidden="true" class="lucide lucide-check" fill="none" height="13" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="13" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
<path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5">
</path>
</svg>Changed update file gathered</p>
<p data-demo-event="2">
<svg aria-hidden="true" class="lucide lucide-chart-column" fill="none" height="13" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="13" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
<path d="M3 3v16a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h16">
</path>
<path d="M18 17V9">
</path>
<path d="M13 17V5">
</path>
<path d="M8 17v-3">
</path>
</svg>Table and chart refreshed</p>
<p data-demo-event="3">
<svg aria-hidden="true" class="lucide lucide-sparkles" fill="none" height="13" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="13" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
<path d="M11.017 2.814a1 1 0 0 1 1.966 0l1.051 5.558a2 2 0 0 0 1.594 1.594l5.558 1.051a1 1 0 0 1 0 1.966l-5.558 1.051a2 2 0 0 0-1.594 1.594l-1.051 5.558a1 1 0 0 1-1.966 0l-1.051-5.558a2 2 0 0 0-1.594-1.594l-5.558-1.051a1 1 0 0 1 0-1.966l5.558-1.051a2 2 0 0 0 1.594-1.594z">
</path>
<path d="M20 2v4">
</path>
<path d="M22 4h-4">
</path>
<circle cx="4" cy="20" r="2">
</circle>
</svg>Overnight note added locally</p>
</div>
<div class="ls-overnight-note">
<span>OVERNIGHT NOTES <i>ON THIS MAC</i>
</span>
<p>Launch is now 6 of 8 tasks complete, up from 4. Two fewer tasks remain.</p>
</div>
<p class="ls-demo-review-label" data-demo-review-label="true">Changes will be marked for review.</p>
<div class="ls-demo-decisions">
<button data-demo-keep="true" disabled="" type="button">Keep</button>
<button data-demo-revert="true" disabled="" type="button">Revert</button>
</div>
<output aria-live="polite" data-demo-decision="true">
</output>
</div>
</div>
<div class="ls-window-bottom">
<span>
<svg aria-hidden="true" class="lucide lucide-shield-check" fill="none" height="13" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="13" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
<path d="M20 13c0 5-3.5 7.5-7.66 8.95a1 1 0 0 1-.67-.01C7.5 20.5 4 18 4 13V6a1 1 0 0 1 1-1c2 0 4.5-1.2 6.24-2.72a1.17 1.17 0 0 1 1.52 0C14.51 3.81 17 5 19 5a1 1 0 0 1 1 1z">
</path>
<path d="m9 12 2 2 4-4">
</path>
</svg>Files you own. Changes you can trace.</span>
<span data-demo-bottom="true">Waiting for the next shift</span>
</div>
</div>
<div class="ls-demo-controls">
<div aria-label="Illustration progress" class="ls-demo-stages">
<span data-demo-stage="0">01 Sources</span>
<span data-demo-stage="1">02 Refresh</span>
<span data-demo-stage="2">03 Notes</span>
<span data-demo-stage="3">04 Review</span>
</div>
<div>
<button aria-label="Next animation step" data-demo-next="true" type="button">
<svg aria-hidden="true" class="lucide lucide-chevron-right" fill="none" height="17" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="17" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
<path d="m9 18 6-6-6-6">
</path>
</svg>
</button>
<button aria-label="Replay product animation" data-demo-replay="true" type="button">
<svg aria-hidden="true" class="lucide lucide-rotate-ccw" fill="none" height="15" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="15" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
<path d="M3 12a9 9 0 1 0 9-9 9.75 9.75 0 0 0-6.74 2.74L3 8">
</path>
<path d="M3 3v5h5">
</path>
</svg>
</button>
</div>
</div>
<p class="ls-demo-caption">Illustrative v1.6 workflow · Sample data · Overnight notes require Pro</p>
</div>
